  "instructions": [
    "Melt butter over medium heat. Add onion, celery, carrots, garlic, and broccoli. Saut\u00e9 until soft.",
    "Stir in flour. Add chicken broth and bouillon. Stir to combine.",
    "Add bay leaf. Bring to boil, cover, cook broccoli florets 2\u20133 min until tender.",
    "Remove bay leaf.",
    "Gradually stir in milk. Add white pepper and nutmeg.",
    "Cook and stir until heated through. Do not boil.",
    "Allow to cool to room temp. Blend in two batches until smooth.",
    "Warm on stove before serving."
  ],
